12
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.833
Pequeña escoria.

13
00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:25.266
Voy a estrangularte.

14
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.800
Mira que tipo de

15
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.033
